# zip_open: a WinZip AES entry using AE-2 (extra field 0x9901 version 2) must
# have a zero CRC field. Here entry 1 is an AE-256 AE-2 entry whose local and
# central CRC fields are both 0x12345678, which is rejected under ZIP_CHECKCONS.
program tryopen
arguments -c -s test.zzip
file test.zzip incons-ae2-nonzero-crc.zip
return 1
stdout
opening 'test.zzip' returned error Zip archive inconsistent: entry 1: CRC not zero for AE-2 encrypted entry
end-of-inline-data
stderr
1 errors
end-of-inline-data
